<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title><%= assignment.title %> - 과제 제출</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <a href="/" class="brand">📚 과제 제출 사이트</a>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h1><%= assignment.title %></h1>
      <% if (assignment.description) { %><p><%= assignment.description %></p><% } %>
      <% if (assignment.due_date) { %><p class="muted">마감일: <%= assignment.due_date %></p><% } %>

      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="error-box"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>

      <form method="POST" action="/assignments/<%= assignment.id %>/submit" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <label for="student_name">이름 *</label>
        <input type="text" id="student_name" name="student_name" required />

        <label for="student_number">학번</label>
        <input type="text" id="student_number" name="student_number" placeholder="예: 20301" />

        <label for="file">제출 파일 *</label>
        <input type="file" id="file" name="file" required />

        <label for="submission_password">제출물 비밀번호 * (4자 이상)</label>
        <input type="password" id="submission_password" name="submission_password" required minlength="4" autocomplete="new-password" />
        <label for="submission_password_confirm">비밀번호 확인 *</label>
        <input type="password" id="submission_password_confirm" name="submission_password_confirm" required minlength="4" autocomplete="new-password" />
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:6px;">이 비밀번호는 다른 사람이 알 수 없습니다. 나중에 이 파일을 다시 열어보거나, 재제출/삭제할 때 필요하니 꼭 기억해두세요.</p>

        <button type="submit">제출하기</button>
      </form>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:20px; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/assignments/<%= assignment.id %>/manage" style="color: var(--muted);">이미 제출했나요? 내 제출물 확인/재제출/삭제 →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
